				remediationAction: "Call analyze_function (CLI: `rea function`) for the same procedure. It returns assembly, callers, callees, references and basic blocks from the Ghidra listing and records this decompiler failure under facet_availability.pseudocode. Repeating the unchanged decompile request is not expected to succeed."
